          ]
        },
        "202490005": {
          "id": 202490005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Congrats to Madam Pearl on unlocking the \"Pearliefin\" new form!",
          "next": [
            202490006
          ]
        },
        "202490006": {
          "id": 202490006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Thank you. Pearliefin is adorable, and very true to character.",
          "next": [
            202490010
          ]
        },
        "202490007": {
          "id": 202490007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You came just to tell me that. You must be pretty stoked!",
          "next": [
            202490008
          ]
        },
        "202490008": {
          "id": 202490008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Is it that obvious?",
          "next": [
            202490009
          ]
        },
        "202490009": {
          "id": 202490009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Yes. Pearliefin is adorable, and very true to character.",
          "next": [
            202490010
          ]
        },
        "202490010": {
          "id": 202490010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "The fellow fans in the \"Success Comes to Those Who Piece Things Together\" group chat said they're big fans of Pearliefin too.",
          "next": [
            202490011
          ]
        },
        "202490011": {
          "id": 202490011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Some of them are already asking for a fuse bead pattern for Pearliefin.",
          "next": [
            202490012,
            202490014
          ]
        },
        "202490012": {
          "id": 202490012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Fuse beads! You're into fuse beads too?",
          "next": [
            202490013
          ]
        },
        "202490013": {
          "id": 202490013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "A while back, when fuse beads were all the rage in the Planarcadia, I dabbled in them a few times myself.",
          "next": [
            202490016
          ]
        },
        "202490014": {
          "id": 202490014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wait, so they're fuse bead fans too?",
          "next": [
            202490015
          ]
        },
        "202490015": {
          "id": 202490015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Yeah, we're all into different kinds of handicraft.",
          "next": [
            202490016
          ]
        },
        "202490016": {
          "id": 202490016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Aside from fuse beads, the group has other handicraft hobbyists too. Pixel building bricks, cross-stitching, pottery, clay art, mosaic art, you name it.",
          "next": [
            202490017
          ]
        },
        "202490017": {
          "id": 202490017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But every craft needs different references and templates.",
          "next": [
            202490018
          ]
        },
        "202490018": {
          "id": 202490018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Conviction: It's far too slow to wait like this.",
          "next": [
            202490019
          ]
        },
        "202490019": {
          "id": 202490019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202490020
          ]
        },
        "202490020": {
          "id": 202490020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Done.",
          "next": [
            202490021
          ]
        },
        "202490021": {
          "id": 202490021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "I whipped up a #blueprint auto-generator that fulfills 99.9% of all crafting needs (Pearliefin fuse bead pattern included)#. I'll share it with you too.",
          "next": [
            202490022,
            202490023
          ]
        },
        "202490022": {
          "id": 202490022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You're so into this! You've already beaten 99.9% of users in your race to make Pearliefin take over the crafting world!",
          "next": [
            202490024
          ]
        },
        "202490023": {
          "id": 202490023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You've already beaten 99.9% of users in your race to bring Pearliefin to the world.",
          "next": [
            202490024
          ]
        },
        "202490024": {
          "id": 202490024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "You got me.",
          "next": [
            202490025
          ]
        },
        "202490025": {
          "id": 202490025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "If you're interested, I can recommend a craft store I go to frequently. They've got a collaboration deal: just mention \"Pearliefin\" and you'll get a first-time customer discount.",
          "next": [
            202490026
          ]
        },
        "202490026": {
          "id": 202490026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "An introvert's paradise of a craft store. I could stay there forever... Save Pearliefin's invite code APchyZZyzdHka and enjoy 90% off on your visit...",
